2.5. Experiment Setup
All text representations in Table 2 were combined with all classiﬁcation models in Table 3 to experimentally evaluate the performance of each pair. To be able to apply classical models to sequential data, the input sequences needed to be aggregated into a single vector. For the bag-of-words

