approaches, all texts in the sequence were concatenated, after which the bag-of-word features were computed. For the word and document embeddings, the sequence of vectors was averaged to compute a single vector for each instance. We used 5-fold stratiﬁed cross validation to compute the performance of each combination, measured by the AUC, along with its standard deviation. For ﬁnding the optimal hyperparameters we used a random search, as suggested by Bengio [72]. The hyperparameters were sampled from either a uniform or a log uniform distribution with a typical range that can be seen in Table 3, and a total of 250 random parameter samplings was used for each evaluation.
